          "url": "https://github.com/PrimeIntellect-ai/prime-agent/blob/1fc1adb6e8062bf871a9b59705c1d15468e589f0/README.md#L46-L52"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_ce07b7a70fbc5a4311ac936c2b5a2bb17818428c31a45bf25ff2105a9744140e"
      ],
      "text": "A persistent Python REPL is the built-in model tool; file operations, shell commands, tool use, subagents, and context management all happen through code in that environment."
